                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.01/5–649: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Consul at Taipei</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Edgar</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-05-09T15:00:00-04:00">May 9, 1949—3 p.
                            m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>88. Urtel 150 May 6. Dept notes ur statement “question being asked locally” etc.
                    Pls identify persons raising this question.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
